# Antigravity frontend configuration (all optional)

# Explicit backend API base URL. When unset, the dashboard talks to the same
# hostname it is served from, on port 8080 (correct for most self-hosted
# setups where the browser is remote from the server). Set this only if your
# API lives elsewhere, e.g. https://api.paas.example.com
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=
